window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>What started as a night out, letting her hair down, turned into a night Gianna would never forget.</p> <p>The moment she saved his life, she felt a connection with him.</p> <p>But when bad news hits her family, she might push away her future before it begins.</p> <p>Take a ride with the baby of the Parker sisters and see how one night changed her whole life.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
